      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Mayor has directed the City's Consumer Affairs\nCommissioner to preliminarily examine whether the City's residents are realizing\nreductions on their insurance costs as a result of the NYPD's dramatic success in reducing\nautomobile theft and related crimes in New York City; and",
