      "text": "WHEREAS, the preliminary report suggests that the Mayor should direct a\nfurther examination into the levels of comprehensive automobile coverage charged to the\nCity's residents to determine whether these rates are appropriate in light of the City's\ndecreased risk of auto theft;",
