      "text": "There hereby is established a Task Force on Insurance Rates Charged to\nNew Yorkers (\"the Task Force\"). The Task Force shall include as members the Consumer\nAffairs Commissioner, the Police Commissioner, the Corporation Counsel, and at least\nthree other members appointed by the Mayor, who shall be residents of the City of New\nYork, or shall maintain a place of business in the City of New York. The Mayor also may",
